{"availability":"available","full":"SmartDropLabs/smartdrop-frontend","name":"smartdrop-frontend","description":"SmartDrop Next.js frontend (Stellar, Freighter, static export)","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":70,"created":"2026-05-13T22:00:32Z","updated":"2026-10-07T23:49:21Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://smart-drop.netlify.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://smart-drop.netlify.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:41:33.556Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:41:33.556Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:41:33.556Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:55:29.432Z","stars":0,"forks":70},{"at":"2026-10-08T23:41:33.556Z","stars":0,"forks":70}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This repository is the Next.js web app for SmartDrop, hosted under Mainnet-ops/smartdrop-frontend. Soroban contracts live in smartdrop-contracts; the API and indexing service lives in smartdrop-backend.","SmartDrop is a liquidity-oriented airdrop experiment on Stellar: participants lock Stellar assets in Soroban farming pools and accrue airdrop credits over time instead of passive \"click to claim\" drops. The goal is to reward people who materially back a project early while discouraging purely extractive behavior.","Traditional airdrops often optimize for reach, not alignment. SmartDrop reframes distribution around commitment:"],"features":["Skin in the game — Credits accrue from locked assets, not from a one-off signature.","Liquidity and attention — Projects can target early supporters willing to lock value for a period.","Transparent rules — Rates and multipliers live in Soroban contracts; the app is a window into that state."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SmartDropLabs/smartdrop-frontend/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9efcffc5c6f70cf773cc5992e793cb3dd13605e588446edcbf103eaa6de4169f","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:55:29.618Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:45:30.966Z","projectInsights